## Proof-facing lemmas suggested
L1 mirror-puncture lemma: four edgeless dead-cover islands with
   mirror-paired singleton blockers should route by local island
   current, not Menger edge cuts.
L2 bypassed-saddle lemma: a max-delta mirror seam with zero q=14V
   phase flux and lower-delta same-component flux is a removable
   saddle, unless its seven-owner boundary creates explicit
   owner-current/two-adic/SPEC debt.

